   - API tests for add/remove vote
   - Permission tests
   - Duplicate-vote prevention tests
   - P1 and non-P1 voting tests
   - List/detail synchronization tests where supported
   - Error and rollback tests
3. Use the project’s existing testing framework and conventions.
4. Do not introduce a new testing library unless absolutely necessary.
5. Run the relevant tests, linting and type checks.
