Expected reusable component behaviour:

<VotingControl
  itemId={item.id}
  voteCount={item.voteCount}
  hasCurrentUserVoted={item.hasCurrentUserVoted}
  canVote={canVote}
  isLoading={isLoading}
  onVote={handleVote}
  onRemoveVote={handleRemoveVote}
/>

Expected states:

User has not voted:
[ 👍 Vote | 2 ]

User has voted:
[ 👍 Voted | 3 | Remove Vote ]

Read-only user:
[ 👍 3 votes ]
Only eligible team members can vote on this item.

Do not use a thumbs-down icon in a way that suggests negative voting. If an existing icon is retained for removing a vote, its tooltip and aria-label must clearly say “Remove your vote”.

