Acceptance criteria:

- Eligible normal team members can vote on any item regardless of priority.
- Super Admin behaviour remains consistent with the existing permission model.
- Unauthorized/non-team users cannot vote from either UI or API.
- Each user can have only one vote per item.
- Users can remove their own vote.
- No true downvote functionality is introduced.
- Vote count remains correct after vote, removal, refresh and re-login.
- Items table and detail page remain synchronized.
- Loading and error states work correctly.
- Existing functionality is not broken.
- Automated tests cover the critical voting scenarios.
